rd like Frank Hayden  helped to conquer Prejudice and today  Millions with physical and intellectual  disabilities are active participants in  activities that much of the world had  always taken for granted Eric Sorensen  Global News Ottawa  that is global national for this  Thursday I'm Donna freeze and tonight's  your Canada is Harrison Mills BC thanks  for watching Farah Nasser will be here  tomorrow and I'll see you Saturday for  the new reality bye-bye
 

